deps: vitest, typescript) and mockb (checked out at /home/bradleyjerome/projects/mock3/mock-b,
deps: vitest, typescript). They are separate repositories with separate dependency sets — a claim
about one's fare logic or the other's schedule rendering must be checked against the codeline it
